OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed for killing highways
OL,4,Aworker in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "too drunk to stand" builder who
OL,7,Fdrove into coned-off motorway roadworks
OL,8,Fkilling a highways worker has been
OL,9,Fjailed for 10 years.
OL,11,FVilius Domarkas had just flown into
OL,12,FStansted Airport from his native
OL,13,FLithuania, where he had been in rehab
OL,14,Ffor his drinking, when he was involved
OL,15,Fin the crash on the M23 at junction
OL,16,Fnine southbound in the early hours of
OL,17,FJuly 8.
OL,19,FAnthony Howe, the Kent man he hit, had
OL,20,Fbeen out of his vehicle for only seven
OL,21,Fseconds.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
